{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.33:0.4"], "en": "The Verse of the Elder Sopāka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.33:1.1", "PA_thag_1.33:1.2"], "en": "\"Just as one would be skillful toward an only son who is dear, [so should one be toward all beings].\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.33:1.3"], "en": "“Thus, toward all living beings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.33:1.4"], "en": "one should be skilled in every respect.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.33:1.5"], "en": "… [Thus spoke] the Elder Sopāka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
